// wxDemo.rc
// Embeds the application manifest so that Common Controls Library v6 is
// activated at runtime.  Numeric IDs are used (CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID
// = 1, RT_MANIFEST = 24) so that no Windows headers are needed during the
// resource-compiler pass – compatible with both windres (MinGW/Clang) and
// rc.exe (MSVC).
1 24 "wxDemo.manifest"

